WEBVTT

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.127
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:03.587
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:00:03.587 --> 00:00:05.547
Putting love in your heart, here's Nico!

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:07.757
I'm Yazawa Nico, AKA Nico-Ni!

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:10.927
I have no idea what it means to be an idol.

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:14.723
But I'm happy so long as I can
make all my fans smile!

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:15.515
Nico!

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.851
What? The last episode!?

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:22.897
Oopsies, sorry. I ended up
talking about myself...

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:25.358
But it's more fun learning about me, right?

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:26.401
Right?

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:30.071
Hey, did someone just call me lame...?

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:36.953
All set.

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:41.958
See you later!

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:51.134
I'm Kosaka Honoka, a second year high
school student attending Otonokizaka High.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:56.181
Thanks to declining birth rates, our
school is at risk of getting shut down.

00:00:56.181 --> 00:01:02.437
To combat that, I started a school idol
group to bring the school more attention.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:06.191
And finally, at long last...

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:09.027
Otonokizaka Idol Study Club
M's (Muse) We made it this far!

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.073
Awesome!

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.158
It's beyond awesome!

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:18.036
We're in 19th place! Nine! Teenth!

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.289
We might get to perform at Love Live!

00:01:22.374 --> 00:01:23.583
Love Live!

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.961
If we perform there, our school
will probably be safe!

00:01:28.004 --> 00:01:29.381
Honoka-chan!

00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:30.298
Honokal!

00:01:31.174 --> 00:01:32.592
Love Live...

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:38.807
Love Liiiiiiiive!

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:55.782
Massugu na omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will tie us all together.

00:01:55.782 --> 00:02:00.662
Honki demo bukiyou butsukari au kokoro Even with
our clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:05.417
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:10.046
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:02:10.046 --> 00:02:11.089
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:14.968
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:15.969
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:19.806
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:20.849
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:24.978
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:29.607
(kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STAR!) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:02:29.607 --> 00:02:34.612
Sorezore ga Sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:02:34.612 --> 00:02:39.284
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:02:39.284 --> 00:02:44.414
Sorezore no Sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:02:44.414 --> 00:02:49.419
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:02:49.419 --> 00:02:54.883
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:02:54.883 --> 00:03:02.515
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:03:03.892 --> 00:03:07.270
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:03:09.606 --> 00:03:10.857
Good job!

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:13.401
Everyone's talking about you!

00:03:14.652 --> 00:03:17.489
There, there. That's a good girl.

00:03:17.489 --> 00:03:21.117
Knowing you, we figured you'd get
bored of the idol thing overnight.

00:03:22.285 --> 00:03:27.624
#11 - The Greatest Concert But it means we got to see the
debut concert of u's, a group performing at Love Live!

00:03:27.999 --> 00:03:29.459
I'm loving it.

00:03:29.459 --> 00:03:30.418
Me, too!

00:03:30.919 --> 00:03:32.545
Honoka. Good morning.

00:03:33.171 --> 00:03:35.465
Eli-chan! Good morning!

00:03:36.466 --> 00:03:38.510
Honoka-chan, she's your senior!

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:43.890
It's cool. We decided to stop talking to
each other like upper- and underclassmen.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.975
Amazing! You're like real celebrities...!

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:48.478
My ...autograph®?

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:50.897
You're going to be famous, so...

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:52.273
Give me a keepsake!

00:03:53.483 --> 00:03:56.444
I asked Sonoda-san for hers earlier, but...

00:03:57.695 --> 00:03:58.613
Where is it?

00:04:01.825 --> 00:04:02.742
Sonoda Umi

00:04:03.535 --> 00:04:04.202
Tiny!

00:04:04.202 --> 00:04:08.623
I know, right? She said it was embarrassing,
so that was as large as she could write it.

00:04:08.623 --> 00:04:11.209
That's why... Make yours huge, Honokal!

00:04:11.209 --> 00:04:13.127
Uh, okay...

00:04:13.711 --> 00:04:15.046
Kosaka Hono(ka)

00:04:15.547 --> 00:04:17.757
Oops, the last character didn't fit.

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:20.635
You two really are polar opposites.

00:04:20.635 --> 00:04:23.638
I asked Yazawa-senpai for hers, but...

00:04:24.138 --> 00:04:26.850
Sorry, I'm off the clock right now.

00:04:27.809 --> 00:04:30.770
We're not actual celebrities or anything...

00:04:31.354 --> 00:04:34.148
Huh? Where's Kotori-chan?

00:04:34.816 --> 00:04:36.651
Did you really do that report?

00:04:36.651 --> 00:04:38.236
- I really did.
- Really?

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:52.083
We get to perform on this
stage if we make it in...

00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:53.793
It's so awesome...

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.670
Why all the swooning?

00:04:56.588 --> 00:04:58.673
Just 'cuz we get to perform in Love Live?

00:05:00.925 --> 00:05:03.720
You've really done it now...Nico!

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.930
No! It's too early to celebrate.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:07.557
It's not set in stone.

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:09.934
Let's keep giving it our all!

00:05:09.934 --> 00:05:11.352
My sentiments exactly.

00:05:14.731 --> 00:05:16.941
Seven consecutive days of concerts?

00:05:16.941 --> 00:05:18.318
That's a lot.

00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:20.111
All groups ranked 20th place and higher...

00:05:20.111 --> 00:05:23.615
will be able to participate in
Love Live, two weeks from now.

00:05:23.615 --> 00:05:26.951
Every school idol group will focus all
their efforts in these final weeks.

00:05:26.951 --> 00:05:30.872
There's no way that the groups who
aren't in the top 20 have given up.

00:05:30.872 --> 00:05:35.835
Plenty of groups will do their best to
catch up and win their spot at the event.

00:05:36.628 --> 00:05:39.505
In other words, it's an even
steeper uphill battle now.

00:05:39.505 --> 00:05:41.591
Yes, if we're being blunt about it.

00:05:42.133 --> 00:05:43.718
We can't celebrate quite yet.

00:05:44.218 --> 00:05:46.512
All right. Let's work harder than hard!

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:50.767
Doing something special at this point
won't have much impact, though.

00:05:50.767 --> 00:05:55.772
First, let's focus on making our concert
during the school festival the best it can be.

00:05:55.772 --> 00:05:56.981
That'll be our goal.

00:05:57.231 --> 00:06:00.693
All right. So why not give
your club president a job?

00:06:01.277 --> 00:06:04.072
Fine. Nico, I have a task
perfectly suited for you.

00:06:05.657 --> 00:06:06.574
What?

00:06:09.452 --> 00:06:11.829
- We did it!
- Oh, President...!

00:06:12.372 --> 00:06:14.874
Calligraphy Club, we hereby
grant you permission...

00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:17.293
to use the auditorium for one
hour, starting at 3:00 p.m.

00:06:17.293 --> 00:06:18.878
Yay!

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:21.506
Why is there a lottery to use the auditorium?

00:06:21.506 --> 00:06:23.800
It's an old tradition, apparently...

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:24.717
Nico-chan.

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:28.137
Next up, Idol Study Club.

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.266
You ready for me?

00:06:32.266 --> 00:06:34.727
D-Do your best.

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:37.563
Nico-chan, please!

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:41.484
The outcome of this lottery will dramatically
influence how effective our concert will be!

00:07:18.521 --> 00:07:19.230
Too bad.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:23.192
The Idol Study Club will not be permitted to
use the auditorium during the school festival!

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:24.944
No way...

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.780
What're we gonna do!?

00:07:28.114 --> 00:07:29.741
It's not my fault!

00:07:29.741 --> 00:07:32.076
I didn't know it'd be a lottery!

00:07:32.535 --> 00:07:33.870
You say that now!

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:34.829
Shaddap!

00:07:36.998 --> 00:07:39.083
Why is this happening to us...?

00:07:39.083 --> 00:07:42.336
- What're we gonna do!?
- I saw it coming, honestly.

00:07:42.837 --> 00:07:45.965
Nico-cchi, I put my faith in you, but...

00:07:46.132 --> 00:07:48.468
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:07:48.468 --> 00:07:49.844
My bad, okay!?

00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:52.722
Let's all cheer up, okay?

00:07:52.722 --> 00:07:56.768
Since we can't use the auditorium, we'll
need to reserve a different space.

00:07:56.768 --> 00:07:59.520
The athletic clubs require the
use of the gym and track.

00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:01.105
Then, what remains?

00:08:01.647 --> 00:08:02.982
Our club room?

00:08:03.399 --> 00:08:05.026
Here we go!

00:08:05.026 --> 00:08:06.235
Crazy cramped!

00:08:07.904 --> 00:08:09.530
Oh, the hallway!

00:08:09.864 --> 00:08:12.283
M's music...start!

00:08:12.283 --> 00:08:13.743
We'd look like idiots.

00:08:13.743 --> 00:08:16.996
Hey, I'm thinking really hard here
because you suck at lotteries!

00:08:18.247 --> 00:08:19.207
What else is there?

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:20.541
Why not here?

00:08:20.792 --> 00:08:21.918
What?

00:08:21.918 --> 00:08:24.420
We can build a basic stage here, can't we?

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.422
And there's enough room for an audience!

00:08:26.422 --> 00:08:28.424
An outdoor stage?

00:08:28.424 --> 00:08:30.885
It's true, we could fit a lot of people up here...

00:08:31.302 --> 00:08:34.972
Plus, this is a really important
gathering place for our group.

00:08:34.972 --> 00:08:37.433
It's a great spot to host a concert!

00:08:37.433 --> 00:08:40.186
Outdoor concerts are the best!

00:08:40.186 --> 00:08:43.815
How will we entice people up
onto the school roof, though?

00:08:43.815 --> 00:08:44.732
I wonder.

00:08:46.234 --> 00:08:50.071
Nobody would simply "happen upon”
our concert way up here.

00:08:50.071 --> 00:08:52.490
Worst case scenario, nobody shows up at all.

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:54.742
What? Isn't that kind of...?

00:08:55.118 --> 00:08:57.453
Then...we'll just sing our hearts out!

00:08:58.454 --> 00:09:01.374
As if such a simple solution would work—

00:09:01.374 --> 00:09:05.628
Let's sing loud enough so the people walking
inside or outside the school can hear us!

00:09:06.129 --> 00:09:09.966
I'm sure that'll make people
come check our concert out!

00:09:12.718 --> 00:09:13.970
How very Honoka of you.

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:16.472
Huh? So, it's like, not good?

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:22.603
That attitude is exactly how
M's has made it this far.

00:09:23.938 --> 00:09:24.981
Eli-chan...

00:09:27.859 --> 00:09:28.943
It's decided.

00:09:28.943 --> 00:09:31.946
We'll construct a stage here and
have our concert on the roof.

00:09:32.405 --> 00:09:35.992
That does sound a lot like
a concert u's would hold.

00:09:35.992 --> 00:09:38.953
All right! I'll sing so, so, so loud!

00:09:39.495 --> 00:09:42.832
Everyone, come up with
what you'd like to sing.

00:09:43.291 --> 00:09:45.501
Now then, let's start practice!

00:09:47.712 --> 00:09:49.755
I'm so pumped about the concert now!

00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:51.507
Aren't you, Kotori-chan?

00:09:52.967 --> 00:09:55.136
Listen, Honoka-chan...

00:09:57.054 --> 00:09:58.389
I...

00:10:01.976 --> 00:10:04.187
I...want us to do our best for the concert!

00:10:04.187 --> 00:10:05.146
Yeah!

00:10:05.146 --> 00:10:06.439
Let's go!

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:07.273
Yep.

00:10:11.736 --> 00:10:12.862
What will you do?

00:10:14.447 --> 00:10:16.949
Such an opportunity is quite rare.

00:10:17.575 --> 00:10:18.492
Right...

00:10:21.746 --> 00:10:22.705
Mama...

00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:28.753
Do you...think I should go?

00:10:31.422 --> 00:10:33.424
Only you can make this decision.

00:10:39.889 --> 00:10:40.973
What? A song?

00:10:41.349 --> 00:10:41.891
Yeah!

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:46.020
I listened to Maki-chan's new song
yesterday, and it was really cool.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:49.273
I think it'd be a great opener for us!

00:10:49.774 --> 00:10:53.236
Okay, but we'll need to start learning the
lyrics and choreography right away.

00:10:53.236 --> 00:10:54.487
Is there enough time?

00:10:54.487 --> 00:10:56.739
It'll work out if we do our very best!

00:10:57.949 --> 00:10:59.075
Still...

00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:01.786
We've other songs that need reviewing...

00:11:01.786 --> 00:11:04.789
I-I'm not feeling very confident...

00:11:04.789 --> 00:11:07.250
We gotta make this concert
a compilation of p's songs.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.585
Our spot at Love Live depends on it.

00:11:10.044 --> 00:11:12.922
Can't really argue with that one.

00:11:12.922 --> 00:11:13.297
Right?

00:11:13.798 --> 00:11:16.467
Love Live is our most immediate goal.

00:11:17.093 --> 00:11:19.220
We've come this far just to perform there!

00:11:19.929 --> 00:11:21.305
Love Live...

00:11:21.514 --> 00:11:25.559
As long as we don't slip lower in
the rankings, we'll get to perform.

00:11:26.143 --> 00:11:28.562
We'll sing in front of millions!

00:11:29.522 --> 00:11:34.443
I wanna work hard.
I wanna do everything I can.

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:35.903
Is that so wrong?

00:11:38.239 --> 00:11:39.782
All opposed?

00:11:41.784 --> 00:11:42.618
Done.

00:11:43.786 --> 00:11:47.123
Everyone... Thank you!

00:11:55.881 --> 00:11:59.010
It just means we'll train that much harder.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:00.094
Especially you, Honoka.

00:12:01.095 --> 00:12:05.182
You're the vocal center, so you'll need
to work twice as hard as the others.

00:12:05.182 --> 00:12:06.309
Got it?

00:12:06.309 --> 00:12:08.227
Yeah! I'll give it everything I got!

00:12:13.399 --> 00:12:14.775
Love Live!

00:12:21.407 --> 00:12:23.951
What? You're doing night training now, too?

00:12:24.327 --> 00:12:25.453
Yeah.

00:12:25.453 --> 00:12:27.121
Don't overdo it or anything.

00:12:27.455 --> 00:12:29.081
You always push yourself too hard.

00:12:29.332 --> 00:12:30.082
It'll be fine.

00:12:30.458 --> 00:12:34.003
I gotta work harder than everyone
else so our concert can be a hit.

00:12:34.003 --> 00:12:36.005
It was my idea, after all!

00:12:39.675 --> 00:12:42.553
Otonokizaka High
Enroliment Information

00:12:49.935 --> 00:12:54.315
That's great! I'm sure that'll
get people up to the roof!

00:12:55.691 --> 00:12:57.193
Listen, Honoka-chan...

00:12:57.193 --> 00:13:00.821
Anyway, let's hurry up and
show the rest of our class.

00:13:04.909 --> 00:13:06.869
The poster looks rather nice.

00:13:07.578 --> 00:13:08.829
Thanks...

00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:14.585
Have you been resting properly?

00:13:15.503 --> 00:13:18.589
I always end up thinking about
our concert all night.

00:13:18.589 --> 00:13:21.467
I'm too excited to sleep!

00:13:21.467 --> 00:13:22.927
What a kid.

00:13:22.927 --> 00:13:24.720
You should talk, Nico-chan!

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:26.013
What're you saying?

00:13:26.514 --> 00:13:27.306
I know!

00:13:33.771 --> 00:13:34.730
How 'bout that?

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.440
I made it up last night!

00:13:36.941 --> 00:13:39.235
C'mon, are you really
changing the steps now?

00:13:39.402 --> 00:13:41.362
Th-That seems a little...

00:13:41.779 --> 00:13:44.240
I think it looks really cool.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:47.451
As soon as I thought it up, I knew this was it!

00:13:47.993 --> 00:13:49.578
I'm such a genius.

00:13:49.954 --> 00:13:53.374
- Kotori, don't you think this is a little...?
- Yeah, it's totally sweet! Super cute!

00:13:53.374 --> 00:13:54.959
It's okay to use it, I guess.

00:13:55.418 --> 00:13:57.044
I know, right? Right?

00:13:58.963 --> 00:14:01.382
I can't get my legs to move at all!

00:14:01.799 --> 00:14:04.385
Don't give up yet! C'mon, one more time!

00:14:04.969 --> 00:14:05.970
Again?

00:14:06.262 --> 00:14:10.224
- Just do it! You're not done until you do!
- No0o000000!

00:14:10.224 --> 00:14:13.811
Enough about others, Honoka.
You're the one who needs a break.

00:14:13.811 --> 00:14:16.522
I'm fine! I'm on fire!

00:14:17.148 --> 00:14:19.400
You've been staying up
late and practicing, right?

00:14:19.942 --> 00:14:21.652
'Cuz our concert's coming up!

00:14:24.321 --> 00:14:25.114
Kotori.

00:14:25.114 --> 00:14:26.407
Who, me?

00:14:26.782 --> 00:14:28.659
Kotori, help me out here.

00:14:30.119 --> 00:14:35.458
I think it's okay if Honoka-chan does
what she thinks is best for her...

00:14:35.458 --> 00:14:37.793
See? Even Kotori-chan agrees with me!

00:14:45.342 --> 00:14:47.386
Huh? Kotori-chan?

00:14:48.012 --> 00:14:50.681
She seems the same as ever to me.

00:14:51.265 --> 00:14:52.433
She does?

00:14:53.017 --> 00:14:55.102
Did she say something to you, Umi-chan?

00:14:55.603 --> 00:14:56.270
No...

00:14:57.146 --> 00:14:59.482
I've also had archery practice to deal with,

00:14:59.482 --> 00:15:02.109
SO we haven't spoken much lately.

00:15:02.568 --> 00:15:04.945
I bet she's just fine.

00:15:06.822 --> 00:15:10.159
She's probably as excited as me
for the upcoming concert.

00:15:11.494 --> 00:15:12.995
I hope that's it.

00:15:15.164 --> 00:15:17.333
The concert's tomorrow.

00:15:17.333 --> 00:15:19.877
If you get sick, it spells doom for us.

00:15:19.877 --> 00:15:21.712
Take tonight off.

00:15:21.712 --> 00:15:22.838
Fine.

00:15:31.222 --> 00:15:32.473
Going out again?

00:15:32.473 --> 00:15:33.849
Yeah, for a little.

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:38.062
It's late, though. Mom's going to be mad.

00:15:38.062 --> 00:15:39.855
Sorry! I'll be right back, really.

00:15:42.107 --> 00:15:44.443
Ugh, rain?

00:15:56.664 --> 00:15:57.373
Kotori?

00:15:59.542 --> 00:16:02.378
Umi-chan, I...

00:16:03.796 --> 00:16:06.173
Well... To tell you the truth...

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:16.600
Honokal!

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:19.520
Isn't the culture festival today?

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.522
What happened to waking up early?

00:16:36.579 --> 00:16:37.746
Huh?

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.602
It's pouring!

00:16:59.602 --> 00:17:01.687
Nobody's here...

00:17:01.687 --> 00:17:04.398
Blame the rain. It is what it is.

00:17:04.398 --> 00:17:07.901
We'll need to rely on our singing
to pull people toward us.

00:17:08.944 --> 00:17:11.196
Now I'm starting to get fired up!

00:17:11.196 --> 00:17:13.449
- Nico-Nico-Ni!
- Are you sure?

00:17:13.449 --> 00:17:14.158
Yep...

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:20.456
I couldn't tell Honoka-chan or the
others before our big concert.

00:17:20.456 --> 00:17:22.291
Isn't the deadline today, though?

00:17:22.958 --> 00:17:27.171
Yep. That's why I have to tell
them right after we finish.

00:17:27.838 --> 00:17:30.883
I'll tell everyone. Including Honoka-chan.

00:17:36.722 --> 00:17:39.642
Welcome! We're open for business!

00:17:41.143 --> 00:17:42.227
Good morning.

00:17:42.227 --> 00:17:44.021
- Honoka.
- You're late.

00:17:44.563 --> 00:17:45.939
Sorry, sorry.

00:17:45.939 --> 00:17:48.192
I can't believe I overslept today, of all days.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.864
Honoka-chan, are you okay?

00:17:53.864 --> 00:17:55.324
Sorry again.

00:17:56.492 --> 00:17:58.744
Honoka, your voice sounds a tad hoarse.

00:17:58.744 --> 00:18:00.496
Huh? Y-You think so?

00:18:00.496 --> 00:18:02.706
I'll gobble up some cough drops!

00:18:05.709 --> 00:18:08.212
M's concert, here in Otonokizaka!

00:18:08.212 --> 00:18:09.630
Starting soon!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.800
Make your way to the roof!

00:18:30.901 --> 00:18:32.986
It's not letting up at all.

00:18:32.986 --> 00:18:35.239
It's actually pouring down harder, isn't it?

00:18:35.781 --> 00:18:39.076
Who would stand out and watch us in this?

00:18:40.202 --> 00:18:41.161
Let's go for it!

00:18:42.121 --> 00:18:42.996
Honoka...

00:18:43.539 --> 00:18:45.624
This is just like our debut concert!

00:18:46.125 --> 00:18:50.629
M's is what it is today because
we didn't give up back then.

00:18:51.213 --> 00:18:53.382
So let's go, everyone!

00:18:54.216 --> 00:18:57.803
You're right. Overcoming this situation
is exactly why we practice so hard.

00:18:57.803 --> 00:18:59.805
I don't want any regrets!

00:18:59.805 --> 00:19:03.517
For better or for worse, the ranking results
will be updated after today.

00:19:03.517 --> 00:19:05.894
Then we need to give this
everything we have.

00:19:05.894 --> 00:19:08.272
Let's show them how much we've grown.

00:19:08.272 --> 00:19:09.648
Let's do it!

00:19:10.774 --> 00:19:11.567
Kotori.

00:19:11.567 --> 00:19:13.694
Oh, sorry.

00:19:13.694 --> 00:19:18.907
Focus on the concert for now.
We've come this far together.

00:19:20.033 --> 00:19:20.659
Right...

00:19:21.785 --> 00:19:23.203
Alisa!

00:19:23.537 --> 00:19:25.414
Oh, good. Did I make it in time?

00:19:25.414 --> 00:19:27.750
Yes. They're just about to begin.

00:19:43.724 --> 00:19:44.892
It's okay.

00:19:45.184 --> 00:19:47.269
I can do it. I got this.

00:19:47.269 --> 00:19:49.730
I've worked so hard.

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:53.025
Whenever I put my mind to something,
I've always been able to succeed.

00:19:54.985 --> 00:19:56.069
I'm okay.

00:20:00.616 --> 00:20:01.825
OH, YEAH!

00:20:02.868 --> 00:20:04.286
OH, YEAH!

00:20:05.454 --> 00:20:06.705
OH, YEAH!

00:20:06.997 --> 00:20:08.332
One step, one leap!

00:20:10.292 --> 00:20:11.585
OH, YEAH!

00:20:12.711 --> 00:20:13.962
OH, YEAH!

00:20:15.005 --> 00:20:16.381
OH, YEAH!

00:20:16.381 --> 00:20:18.300
Yeah, we're never going to lose!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:20.761
We're still frustrated—NO BRAND!

00:20:20.761 --> 00:20:22.888
No one knows who we are—NO BRAND!

00:20:22.888 --> 00:20:27.768
Starting now, we'll be more
passionate about all we do.

00:20:27.768 --> 00:20:30.646
But we will still have fun—
NO BRAND! (DO YOU KNOW?)

00:20:30.646 --> 00:20:32.981
We're so excited—
NO BRAND! (DO YOU KNOW?)

00:20:32.981 --> 00:20:37.653
Listen up, (come here) and you'll see
what we're all about—(YES, I KNOW!)

00:20:37.653 --> 00:20:40.405
The spot we're aiming for—(it's so high!)

00:20:40.405 --> 00:20:42.407
Higher than we stand right now—
(but just how high?)

00:20:42.407 --> 00:20:45.244
Our youthful bangs gave us this chance!

00:20:45.244 --> 00:20:47.287
(Grab on!) We won't let it get away.

00:20:47.538 --> 00:20:50.040
(Hold tight!) We won't let it get away.

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:53.752
(OH, YEAH!) We'll make it across
the miraculous rainbow...

00:20:53.752 --> 00:20:57.047
These walls can (yeah, yeah, yeah!)
be broken and overcome!

00:20:57.047 --> 00:20:59.508
(Yeah, yeah, yeah!)
We can kick and knock 'em down!

00:20:59.508 --> 00:21:04.346
We only have to show off
more of our inner strength.

00:21:04.346 --> 00:21:06.807
(Yeah, yeah, yeah!)
Break and overcome these walls!

00:21:06.807 --> 00:21:09.268
(Yeah, yeah, yeah!)
We can kick and knock 'em down!

00:21:09.268 --> 00:21:14.022
Use your courage to show us our future.

00:21:14.022 --> 00:21:18.777
You heard what we said—we're ready for it!

00:21:18.777 --> 00:21:21.655
(OH, YEAH! Right, we will never lose!)

00:21:23.365 --> 00:21:24.616
OH, YEAH!

00:21:25.826 --> 00:21:27.119
OH, YEAH!

00:21:28.161 --> 00:21:29.413
OH, YEAH!

00:21:30.706 --> 00:21:33.667
OH, YEAH!

00:21:36.962 --> 00:21:38.088
Honoka?

00:21:38.088 --> 00:21:39.214
Honoka-chan?

00:21:39.214 --> 00:21:41.174
Honoka, are you all right?

00:21:42.217 --> 00:21:43.427
She has a high fever!

00:21:44.177 --> 00:21:45.429
Sis!

00:21:46.054 --> 00:21:47.222
Honokal!

00:21:47.222 --> 00:21:48.056
Honoka-chan!

00:21:52.811 --> 00:21:55.355
N-Next song...

00:21:59.860 --> 00:22:03.780
We made it...this far...

00:22:05.449 --> 00:22:06.700
Honoka-chan!

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:20.756
Sunao ni oikakete yuukide oikakete Chase after
it with honesty, chase after it with courage.

00:22:20.756 --> 00:22:26.219
Chiisana negai ga ashita wo tsukuru That one
small wish is what will help to create tomorrow.

00:22:26.595 --> 00:22:32.643
Dekirukamo minna ga nozomunara It might
be possible if we all want it to come true.

00:22:32.643 --> 00:22:39.608
Dare yori ganbacchae tonikaku jounetsu no mama ni Give it
more effort than anyone else and stay as passionate as ever.

00:22:39.608 --> 00:22:44.696
Mezasu no wa Kkireina kaze fuku michi Let's aim
to find our path while riding on a beautiful wind.

00:22:45.614 --> 00:22:51.119
Hane no youni ude agete Spread your
arms out wide like they're your own wings.

00:22:51.119 --> 00:22:56.416
Mabushii mirai e to tobuyo We'll use
them to take off into our bright future.

00:22:57.626 --> 00:23:03.882
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ni kikoeru You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, you can hear it in this one moment.

00:23:04.174 --> 00:23:09.554
Egao nara itsu no hi mo daijoubu As long as
we see you smiling, every day is worth it!

00:23:09.554 --> 00:23:15.936
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ga mitaine You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, we want to see you at that moment.

00:23:15.936 --> 00:23:21.817
Tonari ni kimi ga ite (ureshii keshiki) I want you
to be right beside me. (It's such happy scenery.)

00:23:21.817 --> 00:23:27.239
Tonari wa kimi nanda
Only when the one right there is you.

00:23:35.664 --> 00:23:38.792
Next time on Love Live!
"Friends"
